de_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a201a7-c04d-7162-b8c5-bde8432ff3ec", "unit_id": "tag:08PL:prose-0001"}, "context_hash": "sha256:f5599d0d082f6448cd14c5c8564776f4d16b82d052b3f7bafee4254236168ae4", "created_at": "2026-11-22T05:08:26.185891+00:00", "glossary_revision": "git:05fb436db16d12c1e76b9142b44f9763b1b6a39a", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.171.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.1-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.1-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-cotangent92-ready-p019", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "cotangent92-ready-p019", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e1f30bdd4eeb251e1cbe20429addf0ebdfe53f0c87a01d343af0a01f5cf04312", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "adjoint functors", "target_term": "伴随函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "polynomial algebra", "target_term": "多项式代数"}, {"source_term": "simplicial object", "target_term": "单纯对象"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为环（ring）。设<MATH_0002>为如下范畴（category）：其对象为<MATH_0003>代数（algebras）。\n考虑一对伴随函子（adjoint functors）<MATH_0004>，其中\n<MATH_0005>为遗忘函子（functor），而\n<MATH_0006>将集合（set）<MATH_0007>映为多项式代数（polynomial algebra）<MATH_0008>，它以<MATH_0009>为不定元、定义在<MATH_0010>上。设<MATH_0011>为单纯对象（simplicial object），它是<MATH_0012>中按\nSimplicial 第<REF_0001>节的构造得到的对象。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n考虑一个<MATH_0013>代数（algebra）<MATH_0014>。用<MATH_0015>表示由此得到的单纯<MATH_0016>代数（algebra）。回顾有<MATH_0017>、<MATH_0018>，等等。\n特别地，每一项<MATH_0019>都是多项式<MATH_0020>代数（algebra）。\n还记得存在一个增广\n<MATH_0021>\n其中我们将<MATH_0022>视为常值单纯<MATH_0023>代数（algebra）。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:6aacc1e4b84e6924b62d0ebc2ec2430bcf85ce10a2a70a6647d2766c88c9f7b3", "unit_id": "tag:08PL:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "此处指所固定的基环，暂用“环”。", "source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"context": "此处指基环上的代数所成的范畴，暂用“范畴”。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "此处指该范畴的对象，复数形式暂统一译为“代数”。", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "此处指遗忘函子与多项式代数构造组成的一对函子，暂用“伴随函子”。", "source_term": "adjoint functors", "target_term": "伴随函子"}, {"context": "此处为忘掉代数结构的遗忘函子，暂用“函子”。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "此处指多项式代数构造的输入，暂用“集合”。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "此处指以给定集合为不定元的代数，暂用“多项式代数”。", "source_term": "polynomial algebra", "target_term": "多项式代数"}, {"context": "此处指由伴随函子构造的对象，暂用“单纯对象”。", "source_term": "simplicial object", "target_term": "单纯对象"}, {"context": "此处用于给定对象及所得单纯对象的各项，暂用“代数”。", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}]}
